# Astro Project Structure

## Current Project Overview

This is an Astro 5 project with Solid.js integration, using Bun as the package manager.

## Root Level Organization

```
/
├── src/
├── public/
├── astro.config.mjs
├── tsconfig.json
├── package.json
├── bun.lock
└── README.md
```

## Source Directory (`src/`)

Current structure of this project:

```
src/
├── assets/          # Static assets (images, SVGs) imported in components
│   ├── astro.svg
│   └── background.svg
├── components/      # Reusable Astro and Solid.js components
│   └── Welcome.astro
├── layouts/         # Page layout templates
│   └── Layout.astro
└── pages/           # File-based routing (each file = route)
    └── index.astro
```

## Expandable Structure

As your project grows, consider adding:

```
src/
├── components/
│   ├── ui/              # UI components (Astro)
│   └── islands/         # Interactive Solid.js components
│       ├── Counter.tsx
│       └── Form.tsx
├── layouts/
│   ├── Layout.astro     # Base layout
│   └── BlogLayout.astro # Specialized layouts
├── pages/
│   ├── index.astro
│   ├── about.astro
│   ├── blog/
│   │   ├── index.astro
│   │   └── [slug].astro  # Dynamic routes
│   └── api/              # API endpoints
│       └── hello.ts
├── content/              # Content collections (optional)
│   ├── config.ts
│   └── blog/
├── styles/               # Global styles
│   └── global.css
└── utils/                # Helper functions
    └── helpers.ts
```

## Solid.js Integration

This project uses `@astrojs/solid-js` for interactive islands:

```
src/
└── components/
    └── islands/
        ├── Counter.tsx           # Solid.js component
        ├── Counter.module.css    # CSS modules (optional)
        └── Form.tsx
```

Use Solid components with hydration directives:
```astro
<Counter client:load />
<Form client:visible />
```

## File Naming Conventions

- **Astro components**: `PascalCase.astro` (e.g., `Welcome.astro`, `Header.astro`)
- **Layouts**: `PascalCase.astro` (e.g., `Layout.astro`, `BlogLayout.astro`)
- **Pages**: `kebab-case.astro` or `[dynamic].astro` (e.g., `index.astro`, `about.astro`, `[slug].astro`)
- **Solid.js components**: `PascalCase.tsx` (e.g., `Counter.tsx`, `UserForm.tsx`)
- **TypeScript utilities**: `kebab-case.ts` or `camelCase.ts`
- **CSS modules**: `PascalCase.module.css` (e.g., `Counter.module.css`)
- **Global styles**: `kebab-case.css` (e.g., `global.css`)

## Project Configuration

Core configuration files:

- `astro.config.mjs` - Astro config with Solid.js integration
- `tsconfig.json` - TypeScript config (extends `astro/tsconfigs/strict`)
- `package.json` - Dependencies and scripts
- `bun.lock` - Bun lockfile
- `.env` - Environment variables (if needed)

## Public Directory

Static assets served as-is:

```
public/
├── favicon.svg
├── robots.txt       # (add if needed)
└── images/          # (add if needed)
```

Files in `public/` are served at root path (e.g., `/favicon.svg`).

## Build and Output

- **Build command**: `bun run build`
- **Build output**: `dist/`
- **Dev server**: `bun run dev` (runs on `localhost:4321`)
- **Preview**: `bun run preview`
- **Default mode**: Static site generation (SSG)

## Package Manager

This project uses **Bun**. All commands should use `bun`:
- `bun install` - Install dependencies
- `bun run dev` - Start dev server
- `bun run build` - Build for production
- `bun run preview` - Preview production build
